ye, China!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Delicious Food > China"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "calm your nerves"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "use to say someone should relax and not worry "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Make sure to calm your nerves before the interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Chinese"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "relating to China"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could make a Chinese dish."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "authentic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "made in the traditional or original way "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love authentic Chinese food!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "capital city"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the city in a country where the government is "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The guards sent signals to the capital city. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to encircle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to surround something completely "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The wall encircles the city. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you travel, you ask and report about things you see. You can use the Simple Past tense to report about things you see. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember, there are regular and irregular verbs."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I ate lots of authentic Chinese food."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wasn't there a wall there?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Must vs. Should"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the modals must and should to give recommendations"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Must is a very strong recommendation. You can use have to instead of must. You can use have to when you speak. Should is not as strong. It is a suggestion."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must visit the Kremlin! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should make a Chinese dish. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should take lots of photos!"}, {"type": "example", "content": " You have to try the local cuisine!"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le16ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research on the internet for a place or attraction in a country you want to visit."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Answer these questions: <ul><li>What country is it in?</li> <li>What is the name of the place or attraction? </li> <li>When was it built?</li> <li>Why was it built?</li> <li>Who built it?</li> <li>How far is it from your city?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph of 7-8 sentences. Remember to include an introductory and conclusion sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph aloud to your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify places in another country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify specific information to answer questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph from my research."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph about an attraction to a group."}]}], "type": "sena"}